{"id":"n48848-1-14","stage":4,"title":"동거 · 同住","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n48848-1-14-1","ko":"언제부터 시어머니와 동거를 하신 거예요?","zh":"您是从什么时候开始和婆婆同住的呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"언제부터","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：什么时候；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시어머니와","meaning":"婆婆","explanation":"시어머니：婆婆；와：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"시어머니","audio":"/audio/dd81d91b759e9ad31911.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65293","senseId":"1","lemma":"시어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동거를","meaning":"同住，住在一起","explanation":"동거：同住，住在一起；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"동거","audio":"/audio/244515f3fb7c265bdd62.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48848","senseId":"1","lemma":"동거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하신","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거예요?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不知道的某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"dd81d91b759e9ad3","term":"시어머니","zh":"婆婆","audio":"/audio/dd81d91b759e9ad31911.mp3","entryId":"65293","definition":"丈夫的母亲。","pronunciation":["시어머니"]},{"id":"244515f3fb7c265b","term":"동거","zh":"同住，住在一起","audio":"/audio/244515f3fb7c265bdd62.mp3","entryId":"48848","definition":"共同住在一个房子或一个房间里。","pronunciation":["동거"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/d0f5193311b1de37ff42.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n48848-1-14-2","ko":"결혼하면서부터 같이 살았어요.","zh":"从结婚后就一起住了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"결혼하면서부터","meaning":"结婚","explanation":"결혼하다：结婚；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"결혼하다","audio":"/audio/8f40b8da9c69319343f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17314","senseId":"1","lemma":"결혼하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一同，一块儿，共同","explanation":"같이：一同，一块儿，共同","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"2","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살았어요.","meaning":"住，生活","explanation":"살다：住，生活；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8f40b8da9c693193","term":"결혼하다","zh":"结婚","audio":"/audio/8f40b8da9c69319343f7.mp3","entryId":"17314","definition":"男性和女性在法律上成为夫妻。","pronunciation":["결혼하다"]},{"id":"d44da011993f2a6e","term":"같이","zh":"一同，一块儿，共同","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3","entryId":"26799","definition":"和某物或某人一起。","pronunciation":["가치"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"住，生活","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"在某处居住或停留。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/93fc52fa81f3f46ba2bb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.042,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=48848","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://